== Matches ==
A draw was held on 27 October 2010 at the FIFA Headquarters in [[Zurich]], [[Switzerland]] to decide the matchups for the two quarter-finals.<ref>{{cite news |title=Draw finalises UAE 2010 schedule |url=https://www.fifa.com/clubworldcup/news/newsid=1324848.html |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20101030210941/http://www.fifa.com/clubworldcup/news/newsid=1324848.html |url-status=dead |archive-date=30 October 2010 |work=FIFA.com |publisher=Fédération Internationale de Football Association |date=27 October 2010 |access-date=10 January 2011}}</ref>

If a match was tied after normal playing time, 30 minutes of [[Overtime (sports)#Association football|extra time]] would be played. If still tied after extra time, a [[Penalty shoot-out (association football)|penalty shoot-out]] would be held to determine the winner. However, for the fifth-place and third-place matches, no extra time would be played, and if tied the match would go straight to a penalty shoot-out to determine the winner.<ref name="regulations">{{cite web |url=https://www.fifa.com/mm/document/tournament/competition/01/30/25/39/regulationsfcwc2010_en_082010.pdf |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20111122160253/http://www.fifa.com/mm/document/tournament/competition/01/30/25/39/regulationsfcwc2010%5fen%5f082010.pdf |url-status=dead |archive-date=22 November 2011 |title=Regulations – FIFA Club World Cup UAE 2010 |work=FIFA.com |publisher=FIFA | access-date= 14 October 2011}}</ref>

